### 🛠️ Correcciones de Código:

#### PlaClubTeamProfileController.php (Corregido)

**ANTES (incorrecto):**
```php
Storage::disk('public')->delete($user->profile_photo_path);
$result = $this->imageService->optimizeAndStoreLegacy($file, 'profile_photos', 'profile');
```

**AHORA (correcto):**
```php
$this->fileStorage->delete($user->profile_photo_path);
$result = $this->imageService->optimizeAndStore(
    $file,
    $clubId,
    FileStorageService::TYPE_PLAYER_PHOTO,
    'profile_photos',
    "user_{$user->id}"
);
```

#### PublicEnrollmentController.php (Corregido)

**ANTES (incorrecto) - Línea 527:**
```php
// Comprobantes de pago siempre a 'public' disk
$paymentProofPath = $file->storeAs('enrollment_payments/' . $club->id, $filename, 'public');
```

**AHORA (correcto):**
```php
// Environment-aware disk selection
$disk = app()->environment('production') ? 'spaces' : 'public';
$directory = app()->environment('production')
    ? "clubs/{$club->id}/payment-receipts"
    : "enrollment_payments/{$club->id}";
$paymentProofPath = $file->storeAs($directory, $filename, $disk);
```

**ANTES (incorrecto) - Línea 560:**
```php
// Fotos siempre a 'public' disk
$photoPath = $photoFile->storeAs('profile_photos/' . $club->id, $photoFilename, 'public');
```

**AHORA (correcto):**
```php
// Environment-aware disk selection
$disk = app()->environment('production') ? 'spaces-public' : 'public';
$directory = app()->environment('production')
    ? "clubs/{$club->id}/player-photos"
    : "profile_photos/{$club->id}";
$photoPath = $photoFile->storeAs($directory, $photoFilename, $disk);

// Set ACL to public in production
if (app()->environment('production')) {
    Storage::disk('spaces-public')->setVisibility($photoPath, 'public');
}
```

**ANTES (incorrecto) - Líneas 604, 622:**
```php
// Documentos siempre a 'local' disk
$docFrontPath = $docFront->storeAs('player_documents/' . $club->id, $docFrontFilename, 'local');
$docBackPath = $docBack->storeAs('player_documents/' . $club->id, $docBackFilename, 'local');
```

**AHORA (correcto):**
```php
// Environment-aware disk selection
$disk = app()->environment('production') ? 'spaces' : 'local';
$directory = app()->environment('production')
    ? "clubs/{$club->id}/player-documents"
    : "player_documents/{$club->id}";
$docFrontPath = $docFront->storeAs($directory, $docFrontFilename, $disk);
$docBackPath = $docBack->storeAs($directory, $docBackFilename, $disk);
```

