## 🆘 Troubleshooting de Producción

### La API no responde
```bash
ssh root@167.71.88.31
widdo status          # Ver estado general
widdo nginx-test      # Verificar config de Nginx
systemctl status nginx
systemctl status php8.3-fpm
```

### Errores 500
```bash
widdo errors          # Ver últimos errores
widdo logs            # Ver logs completos
cat /var/www/widdo/storage/logs/laravel.log | tail -100
```

### Jobs no se procesan
```bash
widdo jobs            # Ver estado de cola
widdo worker-status   # Ver workers
widdo worker-restart  # Reiniciar workers
```

### Problemas de permisos
```bash
cd /var/www/widdo
chown -R www-data:www-data storage bootstrap/cache
chmod -R 775 storage bootstrap/cache
```

### Forzar deploy manual
```bash
ssh root@167.71.88.31
widdo deploy
# o ejecutar manualmente:
cd /var/www/widdo && /var/www/widdo/deploy.sh
```

### Limpiar todo y reconstruir
```bash
ssh root@167.71.88.31
widdo cache-clear
widdo cache-rebuild
widdo worker-restart
widdo nginx-reload
```

