## 📊 Monitoreo y Health Checks

### Endpoints de Health

| Endpoint | Descripción |
|----------|-------------|
| `GET /api/health` | Health check completo con métricas |
| `GET /api/health/live` | Liveness probe (¿está vivo?) |
| `GET /api/health/ready` | Readiness probe (¿está listo?) |
| `GET /api/health/cache` | Estado del cache |
| `GET /api/health/metrics` | Métricas de la aplicación |

### Ejemplo de respuesta `/api/health`

```json
{
  "status": "ok",
  "timestamp": "2026-01-20T16:22:10.063091Z",
  "checks": {
    "database": { "status": "healthy" },
    "cache": { "status": "healthy" },
    "queue": { "status": "healthy" },
    "filesystem": { "status": "healthy" },
    "memory": { "status": "healthy" }
  },
  "summary": {
    "total_checks": 7,
    "healthy": 6,
    "health_percentage": 85.71
  }
}
```

